 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t an objective, one-size-fits-all “best” AI marketing agency in Los Angeles—it depends on whether you need paid ads, SEO and visibility in AI answers, or broader growth marketing.\n\n**Single Grain** looks like a strong all-around candidate to shortlist: its Los Angeles offering spans AI-related search and advertising, and its site publishes performance case-study figures. **Tack Media** may be worth considering if your priority is generative engine optimization (GEO); it describes itself as a Los Angeles agency and says it has operated since 2009.\n\nTreat agency-published results as claims to verify. Ask each firm for recent case studies in your industry, references, clear success metrics, and an explanation of what its AI work actually involves.",
